  "reykjavik.F.list.14.occupation": "Preschool worker",
  "reykjavik.F.list.15.occupation": "Art teacher",
  "reykjavik.F.list.16.occupation": "Engineer",
  "reykjavik.F.list.17.occupation": "Computer scientist",
  "reykjavik.F.list.18.occupation": "Office worker",
  "reykjavik.F.list.19.occupation": "Equipment custodian",
  "reykjavik.F.list.2.bio": "Einar Sveinbjörn Guðmundsson is a systems engineer and has served as a deputy city councillor for Flokkur fólksins on Reykjavík City Council. He is one of the party’s most experienced candidates in the city.",
