  "reykjavik.F.list.3.bio": "Guðbjörg Ingunn Magnúsdóttir graduated as a primary school teacher in 2004 and holds a master’s degree in parent education from the University of Iceland. She has worked as an assistant to the Minister of Education and Children since the beginning of 2025.",
